            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Social Media">
            <value>New Hope Counseling Services seeks to help the brokenhearted and those who are crushed in spirit. Professionally trained therapists provide a full range of Biblically based counseling including marriage and family counseling, premarital counseling, therapy groups, as well as counseling for youth and individuals. New Hope Counseling uses office space within New Creation Presbyterian Church in Wentzville. Contact Luke Calvin for an appointment or more information. Phone: 636-779-0329. Email: lukec@chespres.org.

</value>
