        <name>Armor Bible Presbyterian Church, PCA | Buffalo Area</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X7mtQQ9PHAvj8K5AMIXOYBznhdKxJXi7SutaIcMR8Ml1Q-WLflXZxiM3aRoJLQYmHA8aC6m4ljV7_KFYhFaClQFdEYX-ynbaNGHHk8j_Ee5A1gSES8fMIVgWh-uJrX3xib5mXqOcepstXM2VsrGPSfIySHK44AlxwHlL4abYEx6ImPLr-2N_w1smGLx_x9kKQK9hdQ?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Church Named: <br>Confessions: <br>City: <br>State: <br>Location: 5650 Powers Road<br>Orchard Park, NY 14127<br>Phone: (716) 648-4559<br>EMail: office@armorpca.org<br>pastor@armorpca.org<br><br>Website: www.armorpca.org<br>Presbytery: New York State<br>Pastor: Jonathan Hunt<br>Worship Times: 10:30am: Morning Worship <br>4:00pm: Evening Worship <br>Sermons: https://www.sermonaudio.com/solo/armorpca/<br>Ministry Emphases: <br>Worship: <br>Social Media: <br>Notes: Jonathan has eight years of missionary and pastoral experience, including missionary work in Taiwan and pastoral work in Wisconsin. He has served most recently in Jackson, MS at First Presbyterian Church PCA as the Intern of Worship and Music under Rev. Dr. William K. Wymond and at Reformed Theological Seminary as a teaching assistant to Rev. Dr. J. Ligon Duncan III. He holds a Master of Divinity from Reformed Theological Seminary in Jackson, MS. We welcomed Jonathan and his wife Heather to Armor in June 2017.]]></description>
