      <Placemark>
        <name>Karawaci Presbyterian Church</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X5YYvhJxAHR5Y9NI12bgEIWsCJSyGkEO-nW7om7voeFRuUyTRk6ys1ShApAC6wNVpW3I8PemMP7maWSggFRLcgvqllrxz9_CAKw1snlLdxFfVBR6g6yo2CQOwndzJto9ZiyVNTcuttmsHWixSFXKCKrpLvVDqE5NTaOCnJG74Yf9naCz5VZ3I_cURLU-SSRdcBqLx6hevgHVFPb4dD3jznTXXKReeAgIsmfsFk_-PCA2GWI?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Denomination: Presbyterian Reformed Evangelical Church of Indonesia (GPRII)<br>(Gereja Presbiterian Reformed Injili Indonesia)<br>Denom. Abbrev.: GPRII<br>Presbytery: Presbyterian Reformed Evangelical Church of Indonesia<br>Confessionalism: Westminster Standards: We are a church that is graciously reformed in its doctrine and presbyterian in its church government and understanding of the sacraments.<br>KPC holds firmly to the biblical doctrines taught to us in scripture and summarized for us in historic creeds and confessions like the Westminster Confession of Faith. But we use the word "graciously" because we realize everyone has not come to the same conclusions and we want to loving and graciously help other people see the truth as it is taught to us in scripture.<br>Theological Distinctives: There are a few Calvinistic Baptists in the congregation.<br>View on Debates: <br>Church Name: Karawaci Presbyterian Church (KPC)<br>Street Address: 1100, Lippo Village Jalan MH. Thamrin Banten 15811 ID, Jl. MH. Thamrin, Klp. Dua, Kecamatan Kelapa Dua, Kabupaten Tangerang, Banten 15810, Indonesia<br>https://maps.app.goo.gl/JEBYx4few7LbCpVG8<br>Country: Indonesia<br>Directions: D-Building, Room D-501<br>5th Floor Auditorium<br>Universitas Pelita Harapan<br>Worship Times: 10 am<br>Pastor: <br>Others: <br>Phone: Whatsapp : +62 851-6193-7788 <br>Email: admin@karawacipresbyterianchurch.org<br>Website: https://www.karawacipresbyterianchurch.org/<br>Sermons: <br>Social Media: Youtube : https://youtube.com/@karawacipresbyterianchurch8569<br>Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/karawacipresbyterianchurch<br>Notes: International connections for GPRII include denominations/synods in Australia, the UK, and to the Presbyterian Church in America (www.pcanet.org) which founded GPRII. GPRII also is connected to the World Reformed Fellowship (www.wrf.global)<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X7I57ibf_AwD66M-wE37l7SvLng5smHQms7UL55xNmhF9wK1nR-UrFB14IZnbp1Qexyo33-o-moQkeyn0VqfqMhw-o550eqBnSvZ8xIMouEXndrhXhL2_1ohdQ8Xfrq7Fzu4zsMG4iu-1Ishve_r6EvhjhYGljXv8jtqbMq2StyQM6ZFhmB7M1qgrSD5vZpsykaWcoerOS3ySSz70_tcOK7Nc85fy26h6eku4QxN-r8Z14F?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Denomination">
            <value>Presbyterian Reformed Evangelical Church of Indonesia (GPRII)
(Gereja Presbiterian Reformed Injili Indonesia)</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Denom. Abbrev.">
            <value>GPRII</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Presbytery">
            <value>Presbyterian Reformed Evangelical Church of Indonesia</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Confessionalism">
            <value><![CDATA[Westminster Standards: We are a church that is graciously reformed in its doctrine and presbyterian in its church government and understanding of the sacraments.
KPC holds firmly to the biblical doctrines taught to us in scripture and summarized for us in historic creeds and confessions like the Westminster Confession of Faith. But we use the word "graciously" because we realize everyone has not come to the same conclusions and we want to loving and graciously help other people see the truth as it is taught to us in scripture.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Theological Distinctives">
            <value>There are a few Calvinistic Baptists in the congregation.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="View on Debates">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Church Name">
            <value>Karawaci Presbyterian Church (KPC)</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Street Address">
            <value>1100, Lippo Village Jalan MH. Thamrin Banten 15811 ID, Jl. MH. Thamrin, Klp. Dua, Kecamatan Kelapa Dua, Kabupaten Tangerang, Banten 15810, Indonesia
https://maps.app.goo.gl/JEBYx4few7LbCpVG8</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Country">
            <value>Indonesia</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Directions">
            <value>D-Building, Room D-501
5th Floor Auditorium
Universitas Pelita Harapan</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Worship Times">
            <value>10 am</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Pastor">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Others">
            <value/>
          </Data>
