            <value>Youtube : https://youtube.com/@karawacipresbyterianchurch8569
Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/karawacipresbyterianchurch</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>International connections for GPRII include denominations/synods in Australia, the UK, and to the Presbyterian Church in America (www.pcanet.org) which founded GPRII. GPRII also is connected to the World Reformed Fellowship (www.wrf.global)</value>
