        <name>Christ Presbyterian Church</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Denomination Name: Reformed Presbyterian Church General Assembly (RPCGA)<br>Denomination: RPCGA<br>Confessionalism: <br>Theological Distinctives: <br>Address: <br>Street Address: <br>City: <br>State: <br>Zip: <br>Country: <br>Location: <br>Worship Times: <br>Pastor: Pastor: Kenneth G. Talbot<br>Phone: <br>Email Address: <br>Website: http://www.cpc-rpcga.org/<br>Sermons: <br>Social Media: <br>Notes: founded in 1991 by members of the Reformed Presbyterian Church in the United States. It admits only men into church office and holds to Young Earth creationism. It forbids the "teaching or practice" of: Charismaticism, Dispensationalism, Arminianism, Altar Calls, Abortion, Homosexuality, Neo-Orthodoxy, Modernism, Humanism, Feminism, Evolution, Roman Catholicism, and Liberalism.]]></description>
