      <Placemark>
        <name>Australian Free Church</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Denomination Name: Australian Free Church (AFC)<br>Denomination: AFC<br>Confessionalism: <br>Theological Distinctives: <br>Address: <br>Street Address: <br>City: <br>State: <br>Zip: <br>Country: <br>Location: <br>Worship Times: 11:00AM<br>Pastor: Hamilton congregation<br>Rev John Cunningham<br><br>Phone: (03) 5572 3573<br>Email Address: margjohnc@hotmail.com<br>Website: http://www.australianfreechurch.com.au/locations.html<br>Sermons: <br>Social Media: <br>Notes: We began with a single congregation under the ministry of the Rev Eric S. Turnbull, meeting in hired premises, until the church at Chadstone in Melbourne was purchased in 1989. In 2002 the Revs. Cunningham and Nelson were ordained and Rev Turnbull retired (d. 2013). Rev Winzer was ordained in 2005, initially ministering in Burnie, Tasmania and Rockhampton, Queensland before moving to Beaufort in Victoria. We enjoy fraternal relations with the Free Church of Scotland (Continuing) and the Southern Presbyterian Church in Tasmania.]]></description>
