        <description><![CDATA[Denomination: RCiN<br>Denom: <br>Address: <br>City: <br>State: <br>Location: <br>Pastor: <br>Meeting Times: <br>Phone: <br>Email: <br>Website: Founder taught that God does not offer grace to all sinners, but only those persons who are elected and acknowledge their sins. Abortion, euthanasia, birth control, homosexuality, vaccination, insurance are rejected, and these are sinful according to the Bible. Moreover the use of television and open web is rejected.<br>Sermons: <br>Social Media: <br>Notes: ]]></description>
