      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[God's Grace Reformed Baptist Church]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X7fGwfSB78PEh1i7Sgqf6luZTvcRcAjDlF5IqehGiQL9LZw2505_Yhu9ZjFWQbn5zP2nJI6KPT-spmyzh2r47X336mZ7tLLULJqI3ui1Wm09lKpLyM8JLJNw2sKZmt8jARCJ2HQqxnUbVKMswqrxLD8U68tkAEFinxbmiPPZArUlBdkd4TL3Z7Di2bk5dYBlSjHI8U?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Denomination: RBN<br>Confessionalism: We have adopted the 1689 London Baptist Confession of Faith as our statement of faith. We believe it to be a good and accurate presentation of the doctrines found in the Bible. While we believe this confession to be scriptural and accurate, it is nothing more than a good effort to summarize the doctrines found in scripture and is in no way looked upon as scripture or inspired by God. All matters regarding our doctrines, beliefs, and practices are submitted to the authority of scripture.<br>Street Address: <br>City: <br>State: <br>Country: <br>Location: 16686 Victor St, Victorville, CA<br>Service Times: English service at 9 AM and Spanish service at 11 AM, except for the first Sunday of some months when we have a bilingual service at 10 AM and usually followed by a potluck. (Pr Miranda is bilingual so preaches at both services and switches back and forth at the bilingual service.)<br>Phone: (760) 963-5527<br>Pastor Name(s): Pastor-Elder Ismael Miranda<br>Masters from Trinity University<br>Website: https://www.godsgracereformedchurch.com/<br>Sermons: Livestream the services on twitch: https://m.twitch.tv/godsgracereformedchurch/home  <br>https://www.godsgracereformedchurch.com/sermons<br>https://www.sermonaudio.com/source_detail.asp?sourceid=godsgc<br><br>Email: ismaelmiranda95@gmail.com<br>Social Media: <br>Notes: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X40VBwV6ceoCtQRQsfnPcIthzKPnWb7o9hyRhnTKKPceHXzoB_60ali9IjOGTp2s035nF36YHDKnvd1mlwSisD3LaTANVt0XpdPygBxPZgcCAKXbOxBbd5K7l4tS_K5jE6BCvFRpRllfh_fY4nFGzXQ5xnn0JFCus3F2RE8T6n7fBT0xAsU8eBkAal9lZQn44dnBDU?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X7GbFUCJJAH25qmTiB9A_US0HZg41zs4iDoC5-rMQg0oNzoUrMMdiv3_4PP_tLcyOcMrrt27P5Sto112GQzV1KeOcQ1VQmk3OubxeU9OymgD_j_iqyqSay7sqappvh9C6uUMznr0UILF58AlJ7jYCowFvZsX8mqVsOmLrWzzvoTczR4lWxalrwBHXxvy7euE3kRtRo?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1697-DB4436</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Denomination">
            <value>RBN</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Confessionalism">
            <value>We have adopted the 1689 London Baptist Confession of Faith as our statement of faith. We believe it to be a good and accurate presentation of the doctrines found in the Bible. While we believe this confession to be scriptural and accurate, it is nothing more than a good effort to summarize the doctrines found in scripture and is in no way looked upon as scripture or inspired by God. All matters regarding our doctrines, beliefs, and practices are submitted to the authority of scripture.</value>
